{"id":"ayuda","lemma":"ayuda","pos":"noun","rank":231,"glosses":["help, aid","assistance","guidance"],"ipa":"/aˈʝuda/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ayudas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-ayuda.wav","formAudio":{"ayudas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ayudas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ve a pedir ayuda.","en":"Go get help.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438690"},{"text":"¿Me ayudas un minuto?","en":"Will you help me for a minute?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519452"},{"text":"La ayuda está llegando.","en":"Help is coming.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440668"},{"text":"¿Me ayudas con la tarea?","en":"Can you help me with my homework?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/920186"},{"text":"Eso es de ayuda.","en":"That's helpful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441199"}]}